   {
    "title": "Where it flies",
    "text": [
     "The opponent's DI through the throw sends it to one side. Dash after it for a few frames before the jump, keep the stick toward it in the air, and use the second jump when it is high.",
     "Under it too early or too late, only the first hit lands, or neither: it survives."
    ],
